WEBVTT

00:02:29.324 --> 00:02:31.280
Right? Pretty much every hand goes up.

00:02:31.304 --> 00:02:33.027
So what's going on here?

00:02:33.051 --> 00:02:38.194
Why is this so much more common
and yet people haven't heard of it?

00:02:38.218 --> 00:02:40.654
And what can you do to prevent it?

00:02:40.678 --> 00:02:42.980
Well, there are two things,
scientifically shown,

00:02:43.004 --> 00:02:46.377
that prevent or reduce the risk of SUDEP.

00:02:47.115 --> 00:02:49.670
The first is: "Follow
your doctor's instructions,

00:02:49.694 --> 00:02:51.130
take your medications."

00:02:51.154 --> 00:02:53.355
Two-thirds of people who have epilepsy

00:02:53.379 --> 00:02:55.498
get it under control
with their medications.

00:02:55.848 --> 00:03:00.019
The second thing that reduces
the risk of SUDEP is companionship.